33:Note: The Wilson interval that assumes 1300 independent streams would read [0.037381, 0.060669], half-width 0.011644, understating by sqrt(design effect) = 1.7913. The per-Gamma family of 13 simultaneous 95% intervals fires at least once with probability 1 - 0.95^13 = 0.4867 under its own null, which preamble S4bis forbids. The 13 per-Gamma gates of the submitted script were therefore demoted from a gate to a reported measurement.
