docs/sections/R07.md:7:The pipeline enforces strict S7 determinism with single-threaded BLAS, MKL_CBWR=COMPATIBLE, and PYTHONHASHSEED=42. All 28 tests pass: C5 source identity validates 7 carried primitives byte-for-byte against the witness, C1 operator identity confirms unified ast.Gt exceedance, and calibration checks verify non-anticipative OLS formulations. Naive FPR at φ = 0.15 measures 21.0% (v87: 20.8%, D1), lattice bounds 4.34%-5.10% (v87: 4.29%-5.03%, D1), bias 3.1×10⁻³ (v87 bound: 2.9×10⁻³, D1).
